<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3322015373"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1856139711"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Drive Your Heart"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Poppin'Party"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Drive Your Heart"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:28.930"><div begin="00:01.246" end="04:08.024"><p begin="00:01.246" end="00:03.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">憧れを勇気にかえて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将心中憧憬化作勇气</span></p><p begin="00:04.513" end="00:06.636" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">幕開けを待ってる――<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">静待大幕拉开之时</span></p><p begin="00:17.426" end="00:19.951" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">一人じゃ何にも出来なかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅凭一己之力难以有任何作为</span></p><p begin="00:20.554" end="00:24.193" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">大切なもの ずっと目を背けていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直以来都在逃避着最重要的东西</span></p><p begin="00:24.451" end="00:26.217" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">まだ熱いままだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它仍旧如此炙热</span></p><p begin="00:26.843" end="00:29.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">あの日キミが押した この背中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那天是你在我身后给予我助力</span></p><p begin="00:30.296" end="00:31.743" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">突然の日向雨<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕被突袭的太阳雨淋得浑身湿透</span></p><p begin="00:32.051" end="00:33.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">ずぶ濡れになっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便浑身已然湿透</span></p><p begin="00:33.689" end="00:36.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">この夢だけは守らなくちゃね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我依然要将这个梦想守护到底</span></p><p begin="00:37.306" end="00:42.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">撃鉄の音がしたら走りだせ Ready!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待到枪声响起便拔足奔跑 准备就绪</span></p><p begin="00:43.022" end="00:50.876" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">(wow wow wow....)</p><p begin="00:52.528" end="00:55.714" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">憧れるだけでは届かない!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">空有憧憬根本无法触及目标</span></p><p begin="00:55.714" end="00:56.764" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Drive Your Heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的心灵</span></p><p begin="00:56.891" end="00:58.966" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">輝くあの光を一生<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是将那道闪耀的光芒</span></p><p begin="00:58.966" end="00:59.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Drive Your Soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的灵魂</span></p><p begin="01:00.133" end="01:01.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">追いかけていく物語<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用尽一生时光追寻的故事</span></p><p begin="01:02.170" end="01:04.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">(wow wow wow, wow wow wow)</p><p begin="01:04.931" end="01:08.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">いつか辿り着く その日まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至有朝一日抵达目的地那天</span></p><p begin="01:08.564" end="01:09.509" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Drive Your Heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的心灵</span></p><p begin="01:09.709" end="01:11.805" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">心は叫び 吠えている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心发出呐喊 高声咆哮</span></p><p begin="01:11.805" end="01:12.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Drive Your Soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的灵魂</span></p><p begin="01:12.875" end="01:14.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">幕は上がった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幕布已就此升起</span></p><p begin="01:14.411" end="01:17.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">(Brand New Beginning, Brand New Beginning)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(迎来全新的开始 踏上焕然一新的征程)</span></p><p begin="01:17.648" end="01:21.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">夢は始まったばかり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想才刚刚启程而已</span></p><p begin="01:31.053" end="01:33.533" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">思い通りいかない夜でも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕身处事与愿违的夜晚</span></p><p begin="01:34.230" end="01:37.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">キミといれば怖いものなんてなかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要与你相伴</span></p><p begin="01:38.079" end="01:39.856" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">キミがくれたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正是你赐予了我</span></p><p begin="01:40.514" end="01:43.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">誰にも負けない勇気と希望<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不输任何人的勇气与希望</span></p><p begin="01:43.752" end="01:45.307" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">吹き荒れる向かい風<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">狂风正迎面呼啸肆虐</span></p><p begin="01:45.611" end="01:47.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">身動きが取れずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令我根本无法动弹</span></p><p begin="01:47.250" end="01:50.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">それでも明日を探さなくちゃね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此我也必须竭力找寻明天</span></p><p begin="01:50.859" end="01:53.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">夢だけは絶やさぬよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不会让梦想就此中断</span></p><p begin="01:53.872" end="01:56.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">いつまでも いつまでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论在何时 不论在何时</span></p><p begin="01:56.550" end="01:57.516" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Drive Your Heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的心灵</span></p><p begin="01:57.648" end="01:59.695" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">煌めくあの光を永遠<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是将那道璀璨的光芒</span></p><p begin="01:59.695" end="02:00.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Drive Your Soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的灵魂</span></p><p begin="02:00.759" end="02:02.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">見守っていく物語<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远用心守护的故事</span></p><p begin="02:02.919" end="02:05.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">(wow wow wow, wow wow wow)</p><p begin="02:05.799" end="02:09.162" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">運命に挑む 世界線<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在当下世界对命运发起挑战</span></p><p begin="02:09.269" end="02:10.297" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Drive Your Heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的心灵</span></p><p begin="02:10.534" end="02:12.523" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">産声上げる時がNow On<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻正是发出初生啼哭的时刻</span></p><p begin="02:12.523" end="02:13.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Drive Your Soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的灵魂</span></p><p begin="02:13.722" end="02:15.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">扉は開く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大门即将打开</span></p><p begin="02:15.184" end="02:18.173" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">(Brand New Beginning, Brand New Beginning)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(迎来全新的开始 踏上焕然一新的征程)</span></p><p begin="02:18.491" end="02:22.294" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">夢は生まれたばかり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想才刚刚诞生而已</span></p><p begin="02:23.781" end="02:27.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">キミは誰より自由で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你比任何人都要自由</span></p><p begin="02:30.238" end="02:32.697" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">誰よりも熱かった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比任何人都更炙热</span></p><p begin="02:34.181" end="02:39.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">キミに焦がれて 憧れた日々から<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因向往着你 每天都在憧憬之中度日</span></p><p begin="02:40.430" end="02:43.119" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">生まれたよ この情熱<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才会诞生出这份热情</span></p><p begin="02:43.614" end="02:48.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">いつか超えてみせるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一天我会努力超越你</span></p><p begin="03:00.636" end="03:11.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">(wow wow wow......)</p><p begin="03:22.949" end="03:26.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">憧れるだけでは 終われない!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝对不会止步于单纯的憧憬</span></p><p begin="03:26.135" end="03:27.148" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">Drive Your Heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的心灵</span></p><p begin="03:27.339" end="03:29.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">輝くあの光を一生<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是将那道闪耀的光芒</span></p><p begin="03:29.280" end="03:30.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">Drive Your Soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的灵魂</span></p><p begin="03:30.561" end="03:32.366" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">追いかけていく物語<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一生追逐下去的故事</span></p><p begin="03:32.529" end="03:35.159" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">(wow wow wow, wow wow wow)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（wow wow wow, wow wow wow）</span></p><p begin="03:35.309" end="03:38.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">いつか辿り着く その日まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至有朝一日抵达目的地那天</span></p><p begin="03:38.929" end="03:39.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">Drive Your Heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的心灵</span></p><p begin="03:39.963" end="03:42.106" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">心は叫び 吠えている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心发出呐喊 高声咆哮</span></p><p begin="03:42.106" end="03:43.155" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">Drive Your Soul<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">驱使属于你的灵魂</span></p><p begin="03:43.234" end="03:44.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">幕は上がった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幕布已就此升起</span></p><p begin="03:44.846" end="03:47.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">(Brand New Beginning, Brand New Beginning)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(迎来全新的开始 踏上焕然一新的征程)</span></p><p begin="03:48.092" end="03:51.143" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">夢は始まったばかりだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想不过刚刚启程而已</span></p><p begin="03:51.232" end="03:54.066" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">(Brand New Beginning, Brand New Beginning)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(迎来全新的开始 踏上焕然一新的征程)</span></p><p begin="03:54.533" end="03:58.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">夢は始まったばかり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想才刚刚启程而已</span></p><p begin="03:58.188" end="04:08.024" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">(wow wow wow......)</p></div></body></tt>